#: dialogue/marshal_coiljaw.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Dorthkor's road-drum stopped halfway through the breach warning. Demons first. Then one clean beat in a dead company's cadence."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/marshal_coiljaw.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "The Four Arms keeps six names on its slate. Choose two. I need a company, not a funeral procession with one set of boots."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/marshal_coiljaw.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Break the vanguard, count what came through, and look at anything wearing our colors twice. The North Road is open to you."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/iris_illepah.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "You walk like the Registry counts your steps. Stand easy. The grove does not bill for shade."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/iris_illepah.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "A pale root cutting, still warm from the Loam. Iris wants a few for the grove."
msgstr ""

